{"1400710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gowf: A Golf Adventure", "steam_appid": 1400710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic arcade-style golf with a twist! Embark on an RPG adventure where you level up skills and gear by conquering challenges like speed golf, mini golf and much more! Customize your character and compete in online multiplayer with up to 8 friends in a wide variety of game modes and courses! Golf has never been this fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/beb773317232a8fb4e2ecf5f084c8cbc.webp?t=1781432203\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/f6210b953388608630c2562fd8546cf1.poster.avif?t=1781432203\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/f6210b953388608630c2562fd8546cf1.webm?t=1781432203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/f6210b953388608630c2562fd8546cf1.mp4?t=1781432203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore each course in third-person, talk to patrons, and complete quests to earn XP, coins, and cosmetics. Level up your skills and gear, unlock new courses by winning tournaments, and take on side challenges like mini golf, speed golf, trick shots, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/7979c23bf298fb7d43676328e97133be.webp?t=1781432203\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/528c5f09a5604d3cb4c88b51bbd28a6e.poster.avif?t=1781432203\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/528c5f09a5604d3cb4c88b51bbd28a6e.webm?t=1781432203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/528c5f09a5604d3cb4c88b51bbd28a6e.mp4?t=1781432203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gowf with up to 8 friends in a variety of modes, both team-based and free-for-all. Compete in classic golf, chaotic speed golf (yes you can run over other players), and more!. Whether casual or competitive, it’s always a good time gowfin' with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/7946ea2f57e9008703dac0b25c7f08b7.webp?t=1781432203\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/12d5d402ae4045722c44e76edceaaf03.poster.avif?t=1781432203\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/12d5d402ae4045722c44e76edceaaf03.webm?t=1781432203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/12d5d402ae4045722c44e76edceaaf03.mp4?t=1781432203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy classic arcade-style golf with a 3-click swing system that’s easy to learn, but hard to master. Plan your shots, shape and spin the ball, and adapt to dynamic wind and weather for a fun, skill-based challenge every round.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic arcade-style golf with a twist! Embark on an RPG adventure where you level up skills and gear by conquering challenges like speed golf, mini golf and much more! Customize your character and compete in online multiplayer with up to 8 friends in a wide variety of game modes and courses! Golf has never been this fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/beb773317232a8fb4e2ecf5f084c8cbc.webp?t=1781432203\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/f6210b953388608630c2562fd8546cf1.poster.avif?t=1781432203\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/f6210b953388608630c2562fd8546cf1.webm?t=1781432203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/f6210b953388608630c2562fd8546cf1.mp4?t=1781432203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore each course in third-person, talk to patrons, and complete quests to earn XP, coins, and cosmetics. Level up your skills and gear, unlock new courses by winning tournaments, and take on side challenges like mini golf, speed golf, trick shots, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/7979c23bf298fb7d43676328e97133be.webp?t=1781432203\" width=600 height=48 /><